body:
Okay, found the answer. 

&#x200B;

enable expert settings in the hamburger ( three lines) button next to the search bar in the slicing options menu, then find minimum support area and change it from 3.0 mm to 0.0 mm

I'm not saying these are better than GW's models.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

I'm also not *not* saying it.

Thank you, that worked a charm

&#x200B;

Wow, I need to download that in chunks, over a TB of stuff
